  "content": "<p>重鑿：AE2 新增了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用能源2</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\">重鑿</a> 之間的整合。\n此整合引入了超過60種來自AE2的新方塊變體</p><p>賽特斯石英：\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/825/679/2024-02-18_17.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>天空石：\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/825/680/2024-02-18_17.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>方塊：\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/825/682/2024-03-15_15.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>本模組提供的所有材質均基於由 <a href=\"https://github.com/SuperMartijn642\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperMartijn642</a> 創作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\">重鑿</a> 原始石英與石材材質。\n此模組需同時安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\">重鑿</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用能源2</a> 方能運作。</p>",
